lemma JoltRootFe (g:f0 ≤ f):(JoltFe p B0 M R pu A D m Sq Wp dΩ L0 J' f (Pi.single iT 1)).val= DecalR p B0 M 0 R pu A D m Sq Wp g iT.val.2.1 iT.val L0:=by rw[JoltFe_v p B0 M R pu A D m Sq Wp dΩ L0 J' _ g]; unfold PaneKeyR; exact σArcP iT (AtMarkR p B0 M 0 pu A D m J' Sq Wp R g dΩ false L0)
